            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Nga Ba Song",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n2\nA lovely seafood restaurant on riverside\nDec 2018 • Friends\nI came here with a group of 10 Vietnamese friends to celebrate New Year, we had a large table right at the edge of the river and ordered many seafood and mixed dishes which we shared.\n\nWe also brought with us our own bottle of 1L Cognac for shots which the restaurant agreed to and charged us a reasonable service fee of 200k VND (12 AUD). We ordered many rounds of cold beers to go with the food. All in all a very entertaining evening with very good friends and lovely fresh sea food.Well worth a visit.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 10, 2019",
